Features:
- Add income/expense transactions
- Clean receipt names and remove duplicates
- Automatic category detection
- Monthly budget status: SAFE / WARNING / OVER BUDGET
- Category-wise spending
- Red-flag detection (> 5x average transaction)
- Savings and next-month spending prediction
- CSV save/load
- Input validation and exception handling
